###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Harmonic-frequency errors (MAE 4.37 and RMSE 10.51 cm-1 for the final model) are property errors; the per-iteration energy and force errors are only in Fig. 2.
# - The MACE dipole model (test MAE 7.62, RMSE 12.46 mDebye) is not an interatomic potential and is not encoded. IR spectral similarity scores (Tables 2-3) are property comparisons.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
